---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Migration"
  description="Practical Oracle resources for database migrations, Data Pump, transportable tablespaces, cross-platform moves and migration planning."
>
  <main>
    <section class="toolbox-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">ORASOLU TOOLBOX · MIGRATION</p>
        <h1>Database <span class="hero-accent">Migration</span></h1>
        <p>
          Practical Oracle resources for migration planning, Data Pump,
          transportable tablespaces, cross-platform moves and migration readiness.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="toolbox-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="toolbox-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">ORASOLU TOOLBOX · MIGRATION</p>
          <h2>Practical database migration investigation</h2>
          <p>
            A successful Oracle migration depends on understanding the source
            environment, choosing the right migration method and validating the
            target after the move. These resources provide practical starting
            points for planning and investigation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="toolbox-grid">
          <a class="toolbox-card" href="/tools/migration/migration-assessment/">
            <p class="toolbox-card__label">PLANNING</p>
            <h2>Migration Assessment</h2>
            <p>
              Review database size, objects, users, features and dependencies
              before selecting a migration approach.
            </p>
            <span class="toolbox-card__action">Explore</span>
          </a>

          <a class="toolbox-card" href="/tools/migration/data-pump/">
            <p class="toolbox-card__label">DATA PUMP</p>
            <h2>Data Pump</h2>
            <p>
              Practical SQL and operational checks for Oracle Data Pump export,
              import, jobs and object-level migration activity.
            </p>
            <span class="toolbox-card__action">Explore</span>
          </a>

          <a class="toolbox-card" href="/tools/migration/transportable-tablespaces/">
            <p class="toolbox-card__label">TRANSPORTABLE</p>
            <h2>Transportable Tablespaces</h2>
            <p>
              Review tablespace readiness, read-only requirements and metadata
              needed for transportable database moves.
            </p>
            <span class="toolbox-card__action">Explore</span>
          </a>

          <a class="toolbox-card" href="/tools/migration/cross-platform/">
            <p class="toolbox-card__label">CROSS-PLATFORM</p>
            <h2>Cross-Platform Migration</h2>
            <p>
              Investigate platform characteristics, endian format, data files
              and prerequisites for cross-platform database moves.
            </p>
            <span class="toolbox-card__action">Explore</span>
          </a>

          <a class="toolbox-card" href="/tools/migration/migration-validation/">
            <p class="toolbox-card__label">VALIDATION</p>
            <h2>Migration Validation</h2>
            <p>
              Validate database objects, invalid objects, data files and core
              database properties after a migration.
            </p>
            <span class="toolbox-card__action">Explore</span>
          </a>

          <a class="toolbox-card" href="/tools/migration/migration-diagnostics/">
            <p class="toolbox-card__label">DIAGNOSTICS</p>
            <h2>Migration Diagnostics</h2>
            <p>
              Investigate migration-related errors, object differences and
              operational issues during or after a database move.
            </p>
            <span class="toolbox-card__action">Explore</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="toolbox-note">
          <p class="eyebrow">ORASOLU TOOLBOX · MIGRATION</p>
          <h2>Migration starts with understanding the source.</h2>
          <p>
            Database size, object dependencies, platform characteristics,
            application requirements and recovery considerations should be
            understood before choosing the migration method.
          </p>
          <a class="button button--primary" href="/tools/">
            Back to Tools
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.toolbox-hero {
  padding-top: 72px;
  padding-bottom: 72px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.toolbox-hero h1 {
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 72px);
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
}
.toolbox-hero .hero-accent {
  color: var(--orange);
}
.toolbox-hero > .container > p:last-child {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
}
.toolbox-section {
  padding-top: 56px;
  padding-bottom: 0;
}
.toolbox-intro {
  max-width: 820px;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.toolbox-intro .eyebrow {
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  color: var(--orange);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.toolbox-intro h2 {
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 38px);
  line-height: 1.15;
}
.toolbox-intro p:not(.eyebrow) {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.75;
}
.toolbox-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 22px;
}
.toolbox-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 236px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 28px;
  background: #ffffff;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 18px;
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition:
    border-color 0.22s ease,
    box-shadow 0.22s ease,
    transform 0.22s ease;
}
.toolbox-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--orange);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(17, 29, 44, 0.08);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.toolbox-card__label {
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  color: var(--orange);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.toolbox-card h2 {
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 21px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.toolbox-card > p:not(.toolbox-card__label) {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.toolbox-card__action {
  margin-top: auto;
  padding-top: 22px;
  color: var(--orange);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.toolbox-note {
  width: 100vw;
  margin-top: 64px;
  margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
  padding: 72px 12px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: #f7f8fa;
}
.toolbox-note .eyebrow {
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  color: var(--orange);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.toolbox-note h2 {
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 38px);
  line-height: 1.15;
}
.toolbox-note p:not(.eyebrow) {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.75;
}
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .toolbox-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }
}
@media (max-width: 680px) {
  .toolbox-hero {
    padding-top: 58px;
    padding-bottom: 54px;
  }
  .toolbox-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 12vw, 54px);
  }
  .toolbox-section {
    padding-top: 42px;
  }
  .toolbox-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .toolbox-card {
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 22px;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }
  .toolbox-note {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 48px 0 56px;
  }
}
</style>
